<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Additional Experiments ‣ Nonparametric Teaching of Attention Learners" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Visualizing NTK Analysis</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Nonparametric Teaching of Attention Learners" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>The Use of Large Language Models (LLMs)</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
