<span id="A1.T4.2.14.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Set of natural numbers from <math id="A1.T4.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A1.T4.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></td></tr>
