<span id="A1.T4.2.15.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:284.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T4.2.15.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">A symmetric and positive definite sequence kernel</span>
</span></td></tr>
