<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{softmax}\left(\frac{\mathcal{Q}\mathcal{K}^{\top}}{\sqrt{d}}\right)\bm{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>softmax</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒦</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑺</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{softmax}\left(\frac{\mathcal{Q}\mathcal{K}^{\top}}{\sqrt{d}}\right)\bm{S}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr class="ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E25.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\left[\frac{\exp\left(\mathcal{Q}_{(i,:)}\mathcal{K}^{\top}/\sqrt{d}\right)}{\bm{1}^{\top}\exp\left(\mathcal{Q}_{(i,:)}\mathcal{K}^{\top}/\sqrt{d}\right)}\right]_{S}\bm{S}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒦</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>𝟏</mn><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mi>exp</mi><mo>(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒦</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo>/</mo><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>]</mo></mrow><mi>S</mi></msub><mi>𝑺</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left[\frac{\exp\left(\mathcal{Q}_{(i,:)}\mathcal{K}^{\top}/\sqrt{d}\right)}{\bm{1}^{\top}\exp\left(\mathcal{Q}_{(i,:)}\mathcal{K}^{\top}/\sqrt{d}\right)}\right]_{S}\bm{S},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\exp(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\exp(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the row-wise exponential operator. The case of <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\geq 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\geq 2</annotation></semantics></math> represents a multi-dimensional extension, which involves more complex notation but can be derived in a similar manner.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The derivative of <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}(\bm{S})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑺</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}(\bm{S})</annotation></semantics></math> with respect to the query weight matrix is more intricate. For <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathbb{N}_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℕ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathbb{N}_{p}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_eqnarray ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial f_{\theta}(\bm{S})}{\partial\bm{W}^{Q}_{(:,i)}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑺</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>Q</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial f_{\theta}(\bm{S})}{\partial\bm{W}^{Q}_{(:,i)}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial\,\mathrm{softmax}\left(\frac{\mathcal{Q}(\bm{S})\mathcal{K}(\bm{S})^{\top}}{\sqrt{d}}\right)\mathcal{V}(\bm{S})}{\partial\bm{W}^{Q}_{(:,i)}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em">∂</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>softmax</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑺</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒦</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑺</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msup></mrow><msqrt><mi>d</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑺</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>𝑾</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>Q</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial\,\mathrm{softmax}\left(\frac{\mathcal{Q}(\bm{S})\mathcal{K}(\bm{S})^{\top}}{\sqrt{d}}\right)\mathcal{V}(\bm{S})}{\partial\bm{W}^{Q}_{(:,i)}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
