<p id="A1.SS3.p4.2" class="ltx_p">Let’s examine this row by row. For the <math id="A1.SS3.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>-th row (<math id="A1.SS3.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j\in\mathbb{N}_{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℕ</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j\in\mathbb{N}_{S}</annotation></semantics></math>) of Equation <a href="#A1.Ex8" title="A.3 The Derivation of Importance-adaptive Updates in the Parameter Space. ‣ Appendix A Additional Discussions ‣ Nonparametric Teaching of Attention Learners" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>, it expressed as:</p>
