<p id="A1.SS3.p4.3" class="ltx_p">The right-hand side of Equation <a href="#A1.Ex13" title="A.3 The Derivation of Importance-adaptive Updates in the Parameter Space. ‣ Appendix A Additional Discussions ‣ Nonparametric Teaching of Attention Learners" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a> can be rewritten as</p>
