<p id="A1.SS3.p4.4" class="ltx_p">By combining Equation <a href="#A1.Ex8" title="A.3 The Derivation of Importance-adaptive Updates in the Parameter Space. ‣ Appendix A Additional Discussions ‣ Nonparametric Teaching of Attention Learners" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>, <a href="#A1.Ex13" title="A.3 The Derivation of Importance-adaptive Updates in the Parameter Space. ‣ Appendix A Additional Discussions ‣ Nonparametric Teaching of Attention Learners" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a> and <a href="#A1.Ex18" title="A.3 The Derivation of Importance-adaptive Updates in the Parameter Space. ‣ Appendix A Additional Discussions ‣ Nonparametric Teaching of Attention Learners" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>, we derive</p>
