<div id="A1.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">The derivative of <math id="A1.SS3.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\theta}(\bm{S})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑺</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\theta}(\bm{S})</annotation></semantics></math> with respect to the key weight matrix is derived in a manner similar to that of the query weight matrix. For <math id="A1.SS3.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathbb{N}_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℕ</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathbb{N}_{p}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.EGx25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_eqnarray ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
