<p id="A1.SS3.p5.3" class="ltx_p">The right-hand side of Equation <a href="#A1.Ex31" title="A.3 The Derivation of Importance-adaptive Updates in the Parameter Space. ‣ Appendix A Additional Discussions ‣ Nonparametric Teaching of Attention Learners" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a> can be simplified to:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_eqnarray ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
