<p id="A2.SS2.p1.5" class="ltx_p">Given that <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\bm{K}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>𝑲</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\bm{K}}</annotation></semantics></math> is positive definite, it follows that</p>
